sequenceDiagram
  participant GH as GitHub event
  participant APP as GitHub App gateway
  participant CP as Agentic Delivery Control Plane
  participant ORIGIN as Origin repository

  GH->>APP: signed issue/comment event
  APP->>APP: verify organization, installation, signature and replay
  APP->>CP: immutable event envelope with repository ID
  CP->>ORIGIN: re-fetch issue and participant contract
  CP->>CP: semantic proposal then deterministic authorization
  CP->>ORIGIN: mutate only the originating issue or branch
  CP-->>GH: evidence and write-back links
